#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0520 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable ending in ETMF must have a label that ends with "Imputation Flag" (or "Imput. Flag") and contains "End" and "Time"
#note "Labels in the shapes of CDISC's own ADaMIG labels: AETMF spells Imputation in full; XPERETMF, XHETMF and XP01ETMF (sponsor names shaped as APERETMF, PHETMF and the template APxxETMF's AP01ETMF) abbreviate to "Imput." -> all accepted. The real ADaMIG names resolve to their own literal or template rows in the product and are never judged by a stem rule (PLAN-library-template-label-resolution T2 review L4), so the scenario uses sponsor names to stay on the stem leg."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *ETMF name=*ETMF label="{End Time Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *TMF name=*TMF label="{Time Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADSL TRTETMF name=TRTETMF label="Time of Last Exposure Imput. Flag"
#library variable-metadata ADSL TRxxETMF name=TRxxETMF label="Time Last Exposure Period xx Imput. Flag"
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AETMF type=Char label="Analysis End Time Imputation Flag"
col XPERETMF type=Char label="Period End Time Imput. Flag"
col XHETMF type=Char label="Phase End Time Imput. Flag"
col XP01ETMF type=Char label="Period 01 End Time Imput. Flag"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | x | x | x | x
---
